{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "d96987036dc07ca36f914d1d5219412ed86cda15d0b194992fcba4bf16c5b33c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、\nやっと来てくれましたね！　待ってました～♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n你终于来了！我等你好久啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bbcb5bf6b08fb0704631c729f6b41ba8d85a0ce159f3651833d7a7737ced3964", "ja": "うん？　待ってくれてたのか、ゴメン。\n衣装の方、どんな感じだ？", "zh": "嗯？你一直在等我吗？抱歉。\n服装这边感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "4dce9382ff5e0da13176e1cd588a0bfea0226c4c869a17eec51e202bef98b1ce", "ja": "この衣装、ジュリアちゃんとセットなんですよね？\n仲良しって感じがして、とーっても素敵ですっ！", "zh": "这套服装和茱莉亚是成套的，对吧？\n感觉关系特别好，真是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1003_p", "source_sha256": "589ca2c326584ff98b384ee84d6d32d004fc4a08c8699340faedd817dce27fca", "ja": "うん、ジュリアと対になったデザインだよ。\n気に入ってくれたみたいでよかった。", "zh": "嗯，这是和茱莉亚配套的设计。\n你喜欢就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "35ca34db419758a3881d52ef16fbc517b8791a313ef85670df15a830ab62933a", "ja": "せっかくだし、{$P$}さんもお揃いに\nしてみますか？　きっと、もっとワクワクしますよ！", "zh": "难得有这个机会，要不要也让{$P$}先生和它配成一套？一定会更让人期待的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6ec3f2b37b2e694eb2a2a0268919f888bc67ef596a7f3447719dff2531c0038f", "ja": "楽しそうだけど、遠慮しておくよ。\n俺はステージに立つわけじゃないしな。", "zh": "看起来很有趣，不过还是算了吧。\n我又不上台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "cb1d2b6afc2d3e4c8d11f98e169d30d46ae08ef204fd7da62b1285280e178e23", "ja": "なるほど、それもそうですね。あっ、はいはーい。\n{$P$}さん、質問でーす！", "zh": "原来如此，确实也是这么回事。啊，我知道啦——  \n{$P$}先生，我要提问——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "5d0dc6fe493f6c3b06c20392cd17ab6de1f9f7a88970f26cb42b32f0f9407995", "ja": "私の担当楽器は何ですか？　三味線？　パンデイロ？\nあっ、クラリネットも楽しそう♪", "zh": "我负责的乐器是什么？三味线？潘德伊罗？\n啊，单簧管听起来也很有趣♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a20c3ce932d654aba6507dc9837190cdeae237ecf1cacb8eab0bd5475533ed1e", "ja": "担当楽器？　なにか楽器を弾きたいって事か？", "zh": "担当乐器？你是想弹奏什么乐器吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "9c73f1fd376ab50f7518eeaece495b92850365dfdd41284b4258e949d02f19c1", "ja": "はい♪　ジュリアちゃんと言えばギターですよね。\nだから、私も何か弾きたいな～と思って。", "zh": "是的♪ 要说到茱莉亚，当然就是吉他了。\n所以，我也想着要不要弹点什么～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "aca1eb55ee34647e47d0d4876cd7ef1a25c83f06697070ad85bdfe3ab53cea7a", "ja": "私、エアクラリネットなら、\nプロ級の腕前ですよ！　ぷっぷかぷ～♪", "zh": "我嘛，要说空气单簧管的话，\n可是专业级水准哦！噗噗噗噗噗～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c0437fc0c131684352d5583c115743cba17bade5650572b1e181b9a4467a0b9c", "ja": "あ、うん……うまいな！　でもまあ、\n今回はやめておこう。そういうコンセプトじゃないし。", "zh": "啊，嗯……吹得不错！不过嘛，\n这次还是算了吧，毕竟不是那种主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "9800015edc0824e06858e1f0be5120726bf2276f610e56c94cfb293a0fbe3b84", "ja": "あらら……そうですか。\n残念ですけど、わかりました。", "zh": "哎呀……这样啊。\n虽然有点遗憾，不过我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1013_p", "source_sha256": "06b779b4ab7ead2490582e9e8565c4154c5f5162ca57c699f7b1fb936af767d6", "ja": "ごめんな。機会があったら、麗花の楽器も……。\nいや、待てよ……やっぱり、楽器は要らないかもな。", "zh": "抱歉啊。要是有机会的话，丽花的乐器也……\n不，等等……乐器或许还是不要了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1015_p", "source_sha256": "25e155a4e89dfb024b6857d1382e7b85ed17552e742d520fbc7ab9cbdb288fa4", "ja": "麗花には、歌があるじゃないか。\nジュリアと組む時は、歌の方がよくないか？", "zh": "丽花不是有歌声吗？\n和茱莉亚搭档时，还是唱歌更合适吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d3909f72edf4a09210d910bc3ff587cfc020a2b2ba1578540f60787fe7aa16fd", "ja": "ジュリアのギターに麗花の歌声が合わされば、\nそれだけで、最高のステージになるはずだ！", "zh": "只要将茱莉亚的吉他与丽花的歌声相结合，仅凭这样就一定能成为最棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "36164225e5e53c6af491d022bd0031a662fabea5466e1ffa59890b28b93cb1d9", "ja": "なるほど～！　私、歌うのはすっごく好きですよ♪\nえっへん。らららー♪　肺活量～♪", "zh": "原来如此～！我超喜欢唱歌的哦♪\n哼哼。啦啦啦～♪肺活量～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0234_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "4f41866c6f5f0c0c3fd5a810e23987c6ebdf95e98756b05c0ac7361d51e8b252", "ja": "ジュリアちゃんと、衣装も歌声もバッチリ合わせて……\n素敵なステージにしちゃいますね♪", "zh": "和茱莉亚一起，把服装和歌声都完美配合好……\n一定要打造出精彩的舞台♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
